When polymorphed into a horse, you can kick a door.  But you're not
polymorphed into a horse - you're riding one, and your own legs won't
reach.  You don't have so much control over your steed as you do over
yourself.

Perhaps #enhancing the riding kill senough should allow you to specify
what to kick.  (Perhaps it already does - I've never managed to get
beyond my starting skill in it.)

